@startuml architecture_choice
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam component {
 BackgroundColor<<optional>> #273241
 BorderColor<<optional>> #61738a
 FontColor<<optional>> #b8c4d4
}
skinparam artifact {
 BackgroundColor<<optional>> #273241
 BorderColor<<optional>> #61738a
 FontColor<<optional>> #b8c4d4
}
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Architecture
top to bottom direction
component "Layers (chosen)\n• Application orchestrates the work\n• Services: hardware adapters, C libraries\n• Zephyr drivers are the bottom layer" as layers #1c4036
component "RTOS threads (chosen)\n• Workers run separately\n• Audio keeps moving\n• Messages coordinate work" as rt #1c4036
component "Events (chosen)\n• Inputs become commands\n• Controller owns settings\n• Workers return results" as events #1c4036
component "Superloop (not selected)\n• S04 project assessment: unsuitable for this audio workflow" as loop #492a34
component "AUTOSAR (not selected)\n• S04 project assessment: setup effort outside scope" as auto #492a34
component "Task isolation (optional)\n• S04 project option, not an MVP requirement" as mpu #273241
layers -[hidden]right-> rt
rt -[hidden]right-> events
layers -[hidden]down-> loop
rt -[hidden]down-> auto
events -[hidden]down-> mpu
loop -[hidden]right-> auto
auto -[hidden]right-> mpu
component "A/B firmware\n• Not a selected feature: separate update concern\n• Basis: preThesis/02-entscheidungen/open-questions.md" as ab #273241
auto -[hidden]down-> ab
legend bottom
Project alternatives and selection rationale: source board S04,
Software-Architecture and Requirements, project board snapshot, 2026-10-05.
Individual authorship unverified; S04 is project rationale.
Source: sources/software-architecture-and-requirements.json (S04).
These are project assessments, not general technical claims.
endlegend
@enduml
